abstract: >
  Atom-plane source and a bounded subtract-only judge for agent tool
  calls. An atom is a polarity-free fact. The live Hermes mount is a
  different tree; this extract is not the mount. Observe. Apply stays
  off on the published extract until a named receipt says otherwise.
